  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Some amount of dichloromethane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math> is added to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>671</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>141</mn><mi>mL</mi></math> of chloroform <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>CHCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></math> to prepare <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></math> solution of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>Cl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mi>DCM</mi></mfenced></math>. The concentration of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>DCM</mi></math>&nbsp;is _____ ppm (by mass).</p><p>Given: Atomic mass : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mi>Cl</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;density of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CHCl</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>49</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>cm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
